<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Para mi niña ❤️</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f8, #ffe4ed);
            color: #6b4050;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .hearts {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .heart {
            position: absolute;
            color: rgba(220, 105, 140, 0.25);
            font-size: 25px;
            animation: float 8s linear infinite;
        }

        .heart:nth-child(1) {
            left: 10%;
            animation-delay: 0s;
        }

        .heart:nth-child(2) {
            left: 30%;
            animation-delay: 2s;
        }

        .heart:nth-child(3) {
            left: 55%;
            animation-delay: 4s;
        }

        .heart:nth-child(4) {
            left: 80%;
            animation-delay: 1s;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            from {
                transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(0deg);
            }

            to {
                transform: translateY(-20vh) rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        .container {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
            border: 1px solid rgba(220, 105, 140, 0.2);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 50px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(160, 80, 110, 0.12);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .small {
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #c27a92;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 10vw, 70px);
            margin: 0;
            color: #b85c7b;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 25px auto;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

        .heart-big {
            font-size: 65px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            animation: heartbeat 1.8s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }

            50% {
                transform: scale(1.12);
            }
        }

        .start-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: #d97998;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 17px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(217, 121, 152, 0.25);
        }

        .start-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #c96889;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #a77a88;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="hearts">
        <div class="heart">♡</div>
        <div class="heart">♥</div>
        <div class="heart">♡</div>
        <div class="heart">♥</div>
    </div>

    <main class="container">

        <section class="card">

            <div class="small">
                Diciembre 2026
            </div>

            <h1>Para ti ❤️</h1>

            <div class="heart-big">
                💗
            </div>

            <p class="subtitle">
                Preparé algo pequeñito para hacer
                que cada día de diciembre tenga
                un pedacito de nosotros.
            </p>

            <a href="calendar.html" class="start-button">
                Abrir nuestro diciembre ✨
            </a>

            <div class="signature">
                Hecho con mucho amor ♡
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
